1506091.steps:
1. Configure X0 as default LAN using a static IP, configure X1 as primary WAN using static IP, configure X2 as secondary WAN using DHCP mode;
2. Enable Load Balancing, select Round Robin based WLB;<span class="Apple-converted-space"> 3. Start with src-dst checkbox in OFF setting;
4. Start traffic from same source IP address and same destination IP address, but with different source TCP ports and different destination TCP ports e.g. FTP traffic, HTTP traffic from source 192.168.168.1 to destination 10.0.200.2. Traffic may be distributed to different WAN interfaces, X1 and X2.
5. Set the src-dst checkbox to the ON setting to enable source and destination IP address binding ;
6. Start traffic with a new pair of src-dst, 192.168.168.2 to destination 10.0.200.3, but with different source TCP ports and different destination TCP ports e.g. FTP traffic, HTTP traffic .

